{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-core":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-jet-planck-steps","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Remark","doco:Section"],"label":"rem:jet-planck-steps","kind":"remark","title":"Planck steps as jet orders: Taylor approximation of $E$ at the Big Bang","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-discrete-planck-step","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-jet-prolongation","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-recursive-brane-tower","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-color-elliptic","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-golden-ratio-degeneration"],"interprets":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-jet-prolongation","tags":["jet-bundle","planck-time","discrete-time","big-bang","taylor-polynomial","chiral-cubic","golden-ratio","brane-tower","information-theory","finite-field"],"text":"jet-planck-steps.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"rem:jet-planck-steps\"></a><p>Every Reeb operation advances the continuous time coordinate by one Planck unit. Because the time parameter <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">t</code> determines the scale <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">N(t)</code> of the filtration, each tick of Planck time resolves exactly one higher-order term in the Taylor approximation of the energy functional. A Planck step is a jet prolongation.</p>\n<p><strong>The correlation.</strong>\nSee <a href=\"#tbl:jet-planck-steps-table1-data\" data-at=\"information-theory/golden-julia-dynamics\">Table 1</a>.</p>\n<p>Each Planck time unit evaluates one crossing, adding one step to the Skein reduction tree, or extending the local holonomy by one polynomial degree.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/jet-planck-steps.md","heading":"Remark","number":"22.3.8","page":"b/rem-jet-planck-steps","qa":{"counts":{"pass":59,"fail":0,"warn":1,"na":17,"unknown":0,"stale":0},"milnor":{"total":2,"notPassing":0}}}
